ort-sports-betting-but-dont-like-prediction-markets-new-poll-finds/","line":82},{"title":"*khardy@stateline.org*","target":"mailto:khardy@stateline.org","line":98}],"metadata":{"title":"Online prediction markets rile up state lawmakers • Stateline","source":"https://stateline.org/2026/07/31/online-prediction-markets-rile-up-state-lawmakers/","author":["[[Kevin Hardy]]"],"published":"2026-07-31","created":"2026-07-31","description":"CHICAGO — The escalating feud between states and online prediction markets was on full display at a summit of state lawmakers this week as legislators publicly scolded Kalshi and Polymarket, the two most prominent platforms. Prediction market platforms say they are like commodity markets that offer contracts to speculate on the future price of corn […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},